# ==========================================================================
# Build inputs — NEVER publish these.
#
# src/ holds the plaintext case study markup and the original Amazon and
# Mastercard design mocks. If these were committed the password protection
# would be pointless: anyone could read the content in the repository or fetch
# the images by URL.
#
# The published case-studies/*.html files contain AES-GCM ciphertext only.
# ==========================================================================
